+/-- The common part of the hashing and instance hosts' frames. Slots 1 and 8 are not read here. -/
+registers [Size, _, AdrAB, AdrBC, AdrAC, Free, ThePrime, Bits, _, SizeSq, ResAB, ResBC, ResAC, Small]
